# The only credential this project needs, and it never reaches the browser.
#
# Deliberately NOT prefixed with VITE_: anything Vite sees as VITE_* is inlined into the built
# JavaScript, which is where this key used to sit — twice — readable by any visitor. Used by
# api/youcam/[...path].ts in production and by the youcamProxy plugin in dev.
#
# Camera Kit needs no key: confirmed live 2026-08-11 that YMK.init() does not validate one
# client-side. See docs/youcam-api-notes.md.
YOUCAM_API_KEY=
